# Landing page at the site root; the app lives at /app/ (and /index.html keeps working).
# Returning users and the installed app are sent from / to /app/ by the landing page itself.
# (Netlify treats /app and /app/ as the same path, so no slash redirect here: it would loop.)
/        /landing.html   200!
/start   /start.html     200
/demo    /index.html     200
/app     /index.html     200
/app/*   /index.html     200
